---
import Base from "../../layouts/Base.astro";
---

<Base
  title="Sustainability — Fernas Group"
  description="All 570 MW of Fernas installed capacity is renewable. 485 MW in operation, 14 facilities. Environmental management and long-term operating discipline."
  lang="en"
  trPath="/surdurulebilirlik/"
  enPath="/en/sustainability/"
>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="shell grid gap-10 lg:grid-cols-12 lg:gap-16">
      <div class="lg:col-span-7">
        <p class="eyebrow">Sustainability</p>
        <h1 class="mt-5 max-w-[13ch] font-display text-[clamp(2.8rem,5vw,5rem)] font-semibold leading-[0.86] tracking-[-0.06em]">
          Sustainable production.
        </h1>
      </div>
      <div class="lg:col-span-5 lg:pt-16">
        <p class="section-lede">
          Sustainability is not a sentence in a report. It is how many years a
          facility operates, where its energy comes from and how environmental
          impact is managed.
        </p>
        <div class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap gap-3">
          <a class="btn btn-primary" href="/en/policies/">Policies</a>
          <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="/en/about/">The group</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="measure-band">
    <div class="shell">
      <div class="measure-grid">
        <div class="measure-item">
          <strong>570<span>MW</span></strong>
          <small>Installed capacity</small>
        </div>
        <div class="measure-item">
          <strong>485<span>MW</span></strong>
          <small>In operation</small>
        </div>
        <div class="measure-item">
          <strong>100%</strong>
          <small>Renewable source</small>
        </div>
        <div class="measure-item">
          <strong>14</strong>
          <small>Facilities</small>
        </div>
        <div class="measure-item">
          <strong>1.5<span>M</span></strong>
          <small>People in the distribution network</small>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="shell grid gap-10 lg:grid-cols-12 lg:gap-16">
      <div class="lg:col-span-5">
        <p class="eyebrow">Energy</p>
        <h2 class="section-title mt-5">Production starts with the source.</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="lg:col-span-7">
        <p class="section-lede">
          All 570 MW of installed capacity comes from renewable sources.
          Hydroelectric and wind power plants form the backbone of the group's
          energy portfolio. 485 MW is in operation.
        </p>

        <div class="mt-10 grid gap-0 border-t border-steel/30">
          {[
            ["Hydroelectric", "Production tied to the water source, operated with flow and level monitoring."],
            ["Wind", "Operated through field data and turbine availability."],
            ["Operation", "Production, maintenance and environmental monitoring run in the same team."],
          ].map(([title, body]) => (
            <div class="border-b border-steel/30 py-6">
              <div>
                <h3 class="font-display text-[1.3rem] font-semibold tracking-[-0.03em]">{title}</h3>
                <p class="mt-2 max-w-lg text-[0.9rem] leading-relaxed text-ink/65">{body}</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          ))}
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section bg-ink text-white">
    <div class="shell grid gap-10 lg:grid-cols-12 lg:gap-16">
      <div class="lg:col-span-5">
        <p class="eyebrow text-white/75">Management</p>
        <h2 class="section-title mt-5 text-white">Measure, monitor, correct.</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="lg:col-span-7">
        <p class="text-[1.02rem] leading-relaxed text-white/70">
          Environment and occupational safety are part of project management.
          Facilities apply the principles of ISO 14001 environmental management,
          ISO 45001 occupational health and safety and ISO 9001 quality
          management.
        </p>

        <div class="mt-10 grid gap-5 sm:grid-cols-3">
          {[
            ["ISO 14001", "Environmental management"],
            ["ISO 45001", "Occupational health and safety"],
            ["ISO 9001", "Quality management"],
          ].map(([code, label]) => (
            <div class="border border-white/20 p-5">
              <p class="mono text-[0.68rem] text-amber">{code}</p>
              <p class="mt-3 text-[0.9rem] text-white/70">{label}</p>
            </div>
          ))}
        </div>

        <div class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap gap-4">
          <a class="link-underline text-white" href="/en/policies/">Policies</a>
          <a class="link-underline text-white" href="/en/about/">The group</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section bg-white">
    <div class="shell grid gap-10 lg:grid-cols-12 lg:gap-16">
      <div class="lg:col-span-5">
        <p class="eyebrow">Where we operate</p>
        <h2 class="section-title mt-5">In the regions we serve.</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="lg:col-span-7">
        <p class="section-lede">
          Gas distribution has continued in Diyarbakır since 2006. Production
          facilities are located in Aksaray, Ankara and Batman. The group's
          operations are managed with a long-term view of local employment,
          safety and environmental responsibility.
        </p>
        <div class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap gap-4">
          <a class="link-underline" href="/en/projects/?sector=dogalgaz-dagitim">Gas distribution</a>
          <a class="link-underline" href="/en/projects/">Project archive</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
